me age as Jeff."}, {"start": 541.14, "end": 542.18, "text": "Well, I was counting Jeff as all two."}, {"start": 542.18, "end": 542.78, "text": "Hey."}, {"start": 542.78, "end": 544.18, "text": "Oh, well, that's all right then."}, {"start": 544.18, "end": 547.18, "text": "I just don't understand how my age has anything to--"}, {"start": 547.18, "end": 549.22, "text": "oh, for heaven's sake, peers."}, {"start": 549.22, "end": 551.3, "text": "I was thinking the thing that would be most beneficial,"}, {"start": 551.3, "end": 553.66, "text": "you know, for the group, would be to pair the people"}, {"start": 553.66, "end": 556.14, "text": "with the lowest GPAs with the highest."}, {"start": 556.14, "end": 557.62, "text": "Hmm, interesting."}, {"start": 557.62, "end": 559.66, "text": "The highest carrying the lowest."}, {"start": 559.66, "end": 561.26, "text": "I can see how you might want that."}, {"start": 561.26, "end": 562.74, "text": "You know what, Annie?"}, {"start": 562.74, "end": 565.14, "text": "Pew, pew, pew, pew, pew."}, {"start": 565.14, "end": 567.98, "text": "Wait, no, pew, pew, pew, pew."}, {"start": 567.98, "end": 568.82, "text": "Wait."}, {"start": 568.82, "end": 570.46, "text": "Does anyone else have kids"}, {"start": 570.46, "end": 572.9, "text": "because I have a gorgeous little newborn"}, {"start": 572.9, "end": 573.78, "text": "that I like to get out."}, {"start": 573.78, "end": 576.26, "text": "A perfect Yolandaoy talking to Shirley about her kids."}, {"start": 576.26, "end": 579.06, "text": "Uh-oh, don't go trying to pawn Todd off on me."}, {"start": 579.06, "end": 580.34, "text": "again, none taken."}, {"start": 580.34, "end": 583.1, "text": "- Guys, our terrariums are due tomorrow and it's already nine."}, {"start": 583.1, "end": 585.7, "text": "- Okay, let's make this simple and do what like student housing."}, {"start": 585.7, "end": 587.86, "text": "Everyone write down their lab partner preferences"}, {"start": 587.86, "end": 589.02, "text": "from one to eight."}, {"start": 589.02, "end": 589.86, "text": "- Of it?"}, {"start": 589.86, "end": 590.7, "text": "- Mm-hmm. - You're a computer?"}, {"start": 590.7, "end": 592.86, "text": "You figure out a way to put us in our optimal pairings."}, {"start": 592.86, "end": 596.02, "text": "And before you all go putting Todd down last,"}, {"start": 596.02, "end": 598.38, "text": "don't forget he comes with a turtle."}, {"start": 598.38, "end": 599.78, "text": "You're halfway done."}, {"start": 599.78, "end": 600.62, "text": "How does that sound?"}, {"start": 603.18, "end": 604.34, "text": "Somebody wake up here."}, {"start": 604.34, "end": 606.26, "text": "- Hello, here's the one to matchbook company."}, {"start": 606.26, "end": 607.7, "text": "- I had to get some answers"}, {"start": 607.7, "end": 610.26, "text": "And I needed answers like a fish needs a bicycle."}, {"start": 610.26, "end": 611.1, "text": "A lot."}, {"start": 611.1, "end": 612.46, "text": "Hello?"}, {"start": 612.46, "end": 612.96, "text": "Hello?"}, {"start": 612.96, "end": 614.9, "text": "I am interested in your match books."}, {"start": 614.9, "end": 616.3, "text": "Would you like to play some order?"}, {"start": 616.3, "end": 618.94, "text": "I had to think fast."}, {"start": 618.94, "end": 619.58, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 619.58, "end": 620.9, "text": "Get away from my desk."}, {"start": 620.9, "end": 621.78, "text": "I'll call you back."}, {"start": 621.78, "end": 623.78, "text": "We've been walking around campus asking people"}, {"start": 623.78, "end": 625.54, "text": "weird questions and then staring at them"}, {"start": 625.54, "end": 627.1, "text": "most likely moving your lips."}, {"start": 627.1, "end": 628.38, "text": "I had to think fast."}, {"start": 628.38, "end": 629.5, "text": "No."}, {"start": 629.5, "end": 634.02, "text": "Man, I think this job might be getting to you."}, {"start": 634.02, "end": 636.26, "text": "I think you need to take some time off."}, {"start": 636.26, "end": 638.06, "text": "Oh, you'd like that, wouldn't you?"}, {"start": 638.06, "end": 639.22, "text": "Very much so."}, {"start": 640.34, "end": 641.66, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 641.66, "end": 642.82, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 642.82, "end": 645.18, "text": "Yeah, according to my system, Ann is gonna be with Shirley."}, {"start": 645.18, "end": 647.94, "text": "Pierce is with me, Troy's with Britta, and Jeff is with Todd."}, {"start": 647.94, "end": 650.1, "text": "Okay, let's get to work."}, {"start": 650.1, "end": 653.82, "text": "Wait, um, how did I end up with Todd?"}, {"start": 653.82, "end": 656.3, "text": "No offense, but he wasn't exactly at the top of my list."}, {"start": 656.3, "end": 656.98, "text": "None taken."}, {"start": 656.98, "end": 658.1, "text": "That's what the algorithm dictated."}, {"start": 658.1, "end": 659.5, "text": "And we're just supposed to trust your algorithm."}, {"start": 659.5, "end": 660.5, "text": "Do you question him algorithm?"}, {"start": 660.5, "end": 661.34, "text": "None necessarily."}, {"start": 661.34, "end": 662.66, "text": "Is your algorithm above questioning?"}, {"start": 662.66, "end": 663.34, "text": "Kind of, certainly."}, {"start": 663.34, "end": 664.9, "text": "Will you just tell us how you chose?"}, {"start": 664.9, "end": 668.24, "text": "I used the bell to make everyone buy popularity and I put the most popular with least popular."}, {"start": 668.24, "end": 670.34, "text": "I figured he would maximize each partnership's audience appeal."}, {"start": 670.34, "end": 671.54, "text": "Oh, I see."}, {"start": 671.54, "end": 673.58, "text": "So I was number one and he was obviously number eight."}, {"start": 673.58, "end": 674.58, "text": "No offense, too."}, {"start": 674.58, "end": 676.78, "text": "You and Todd were four and five."}, {"start": 676.78, "end": 677.78, "text": "I was four."}, {"start": 677.78, "end": 678.78, "text": "Todd was four."}, {"start": 678.78, "end": 679.78, "text": "I was five?"}, {"start": 679.78, "end": 680.78, "text": "Well, that's insane."}, {"start": 680.78, "end": 681.78, "text": "We don't even know him."}, {"start": 681.78, "end": 682.78, "text": "He's a stranger."}, {"start": 682.78, "end": 683.78, "text": "Geez, Chef."}, {"start": 683.78, "end": 684.78, "text": "It has feelings."}, {"start": 684.78, "end": 689.9, "text": "Wait, so we all know Annie was number one because she'd do all the work."}, {"start": 689.9, "end": 692.02, "text": "And Shirley was a partner."}, {"start": 692.02, "end": 693.02, "text": "So..."}, {"start": 693.02, "end": 695.66, "text": "That means you all put--"}, {"start": 695.66, "end": 698.06, "text": "I just worked it out."}, {"start": 698.06, "end": 700.14, "text": "I'm more popular than someone."}, {"start": 702.98, "end": 706.26, "text": "Getting the matchbook shipped to me the same day wasn't easy."}, {"start": 706.26, "end": 708.14, "text": "I had to pay the company money."}, {"start": 708.14, "end": 710.42, "text": "I used New News's card."}, {"start": 710.42, "end": 712.78, "text": "He thanked me up at Detective Awards."}, {"start": 712.78, "end": 716.3, "text": "Somewhere, somehow, I was going to find what I was looking for."}, {"start": 723.02, "end": 726.02, "text": "[MUSIC PLAYING]"}, {"start": 730.78, "end": 734.78, "text": "Mary, mother of God, was I crazy?"}, {"start": 734.78, "end": 736.62, "text": "I was I on the verge of something."}, {"start": 736.62, "end": 740.26, "text": "My mind, real with thoughts, voices, stand-up premises."}, {"start": 740.26, "end": 742.22, "text": "Why don't they just make tires out of payments"}, {"start": 742.22, "end": 743.34, "text": "so you can drive on anything?"}, {"start": 743.34, "end": 744.1, "text": "What's up with buttons?"}, {"start": 744.1, "end": 747.58, "text": "What would happen if Nicholson was a gynecologist?"}, {"start": 747.58, "end": 749.06, "text": "There was something there."}, {"start": 749.06, "end": 750.7, "text": "I need a no-pad."}, {"start": 750.7, "end": 751.54, "text": "Maybe a blazer."}, {"start": 753.02, "end": 757.82, "text": "Honey, I-- I don't-- I don't know when I'll be home."}, {"start": 757.82, "end": 760.62, "text": "How could you guys hate me more than peers?"}, {"start": 760.62, "end": 762.32, "text": "Or anything more than peers?"}, {"start": 762.32, "end": 767.12, "text": "Then I, surely, my friends and I are not gonna let you drive a wedge between us."}, {"start": 767.12, "end": 771.32, "text": "Surely has a point. This list stinks like a butt convention."}, {"start": 771.32, "end": 773.92, "text": "How else could you explain Troy being so unpopular?"}, {"start": 773.92, "end": 777.32, "text": "Uh, I think I was the popular one in our pairing."}, {"start": 777.32, "end": 778.72, "text": "Oh, Troy."}, {"start": 782.62, "end": 784.82, "text": "Fine, what are I just go work with Todd?"}, {"start": 784.82, "end": 788.12, "text": "Hey, that's cool. Whatever gets this project done?"}, {"start": 788.12, "end": 790.82, "text": "Oh, wow. What a great guy."}, {"start": 790.82, "end": 793.02, "text": "I can see why all of you like him so much more than me."}, {"start": 793.02, "end": 796.72, "text": "Jeff, maybe it's just that no one wants to carry you all year."}, {"start": 796.72, "end": 799.82, "text": "Gee, you're right, Annie. It's not personal."}, {"start": 799.82, "end": 801.52, "text": "I mean, it's not like people really like you."}, {"start": 801.52, "end": 803.32, "text": "You're just a good grade and a tight sweater."}, {"start": 803.32, "end": 805.72, "text": "You're just a bad grade and a tight sweater."}, {"start": 805.72, "end": 808.92, "text": "And who the hell are you always texting? Everyone you know is here."}, {"start": 808.92, "end": 810.92, "text": "Okay, let's all just take a breath."}, {"start": 810.92, "end": 812.96, "text": "Don't get your number for stink on this Todd."}, {"start": 812.96, "end": 814.36, "text": "Okay, let's focus."}, {"start": 814.36, "end": 818.12, "text": "We're all the same people we were 12 hours ago."}, {"start": 819.12, "end": 820.96, "text": "Maybe we should just revert to our original pairings."}, {"start": 820.96, "end": 822.72, "text": "But I thought you didn't want to carry Jeff."}, {"start": 822.72, "end": 824.2, "text": "Oh, well, you just don't want to work with Shirley."}, {"start": 824.2, "end": 825.28, "text": "(gasps)"}, {"start": 825.28, "end": 826.84, "text": "You too, Brute."}, {"start": 826.84, "end": 829.68, "text": "It's just, your a creation is."}, {"start": 829.68, "end": 830.52, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 830.52, "end": 831.52, "text": "You're so religious."}, {"start": 831.52, "end": 833.4, "text": "How are you going to do science experiments"}, {"start": 833.4, "end": 835.0, "text": "if you don't even believe in science?"}, {"start": 835.0, "end": 836.8, "text": "Just because someone's religious doesn't mean"}, {"start": 836.8, "end": 838.48, "text": "they have a problem with science"}, {"start": 838.48, "end": 840.88, "text": "and certainly if then introductory biology"}, {"start": 840.88, "end": 844.16, "text": "of course in a community college can refute 2,000 years"}, {"start": 844.16, "end": 845.0, "text": "of mere cause of love."}, {"start": 845.0, "end": 846.0, "text": "- Oh my God!"}, {"start": 846.0, "end": 847.0, "text": "- And what about Brida?"}, {"start": 847.0, "end": 848.44, "text": "- She's not gonna dissect anything."}, {"start": 848.44, "end": 849.36, "text": "- Fine, you got me."}, {"start": 849.36, "end": 851.52, "text": "I won't dissect anything with a face."}, {"start": 851.52, "end": 853.04, "text": "- What about worms?"}, {"start": 853.04, "end": 854.76, "text": "- Do they have tiny little faces?"}, {"start": 854.76, "end": 856.16, "text": "- This is why you're the stupidest."}, {"start": 856.16, "end": 857.64, "text": "- It's loving worms is stupid."}, {"start": 857.64, "end": 859.08, "text": "I don't wanna be smart."}, {"start": 859.08, "end": 861.56, "text": "- It is, and you can't be."}, {"start": 861.56, "end": 863.76, "text": "- Guys, I just figured it all out."}, {"start": 863.76, "end": 864.6, "text": "Pierce, wake up."}, {"start": 864.6, "end": 865.76, "text": "Jeff is gonna heal us."}, {"start": 865.76, "end": 868.36, "text": "We have been looking at this totally wrong."}, {"start": 868.36, "end": 871.06, "text": "There's no way I'm unpopular."}, {"start": 871.06, "end": 875.56, "text": "One of you monsters just put me last in a petty attempt to humble me."}, {"start": 875.56, "end": 876.76, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 876.76, "end": 880.44, "text": "I just had a terrible nightmare that Jeff was a pompous ass."}, {"start": 880.44, "end": 882.08, "text": "Also, Todd was there."}, {"start": 882.08, "end": 883.16, "text": "Uh, no offense, Todd."}, {"start": 892.76, "end": 894.92, "text": "I poked my nose where it didn't belong."}, {"start": 894.92, "end": 896.04, "text": "Someone."}, {"start": 896.04, "end": 897.56, "text": "Or something."}, {"start": 897.56, "end": 899.56, "text": "Sent me a message."}, {"start": 900.56, "end": 903.56, "text": "Veronica, it's my fault she got mixed up in all this."}, {"start": 906.56, "end": 908.56, "text": "- Come on, I'm on the side! - Come on, I'm on the side!"}, {"start": 908.56, "end": 911.56, "text": "Ah, Todd, pretty sure I heard a fire alarm."}, {"start": 911.56, "end": 913.56, "text": "Nobody's going home until we see those ballots."}, {"start": 913.56, "end": 915.56, "text": "See the ballots? Are you crazy?"}, {"start": 915.56, "end": 917.56, "text": "I say, let's lay our cards in the table"}, {"start": 917.56, "end": 919.56, "text": "and see what everyone really thinks of each other."}, {"start": 919.56, "end": 921.56, "text": "Get behind me, Abbot."}, {"start": 921.56, "end": 923.56, "text": "- Oh! - Ah!"}, {"start": 923.56, "end": 925.56, "text": "- Stop it! - Just--"}, {"start": 925.56, "end": 926.56, "text": "- Don't let them back! - Get back!"}, {"start": 926.56, "end": 929.16, "text": "- Get back. - I'm doing this for all of us."}, {"start": 929.16, "end": 931.36, "text": "Oh, no, she's got her hair. Why don't I do it?"}, {"start": 931.36, "end": 933.36, "text": "- Don't. - Oh, no."}, {"start": 933.36, "end": 934.36, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 934.36, "end": 936.36, "text": "The turtle is in there!"}, {"start": 936.36, "end": 937.36, "text": "Oh, my God!"}, {"start": 937.36, "end": 939.16, "text": "I'm so sorry."}, {"start": 939.16, "end": 943.56, "text": "What is wrong with you people?"}, {"start": 943.56, "end": 945.96, "text": "Ha!"}, {"start": 945.96, "end": 949.16, "text": "I thought you were supposed to be friends."}, {"start": 949.16, "end": 953.56, "text": "I thought you were supposed to love each other."}, {"start": 953.56, "end": 961.56, "text": "Your love is weird and toxic and it destroys everything it touches."}, {"start": 961.56, "end": 971.56, "text": "I no longer care about grades or biology or finally graduating from college like I promised my dying father."}, {"start": 973.06, "end": 974.56, "text": "I'm going home."}, {"start": 976.06, "end": 982.56, "text": "I'm gonna hold my wife and my child close and I am gonna finally take my insulin shot."}, {"start": 983.56, "end": 985.56, "text": "A fenced taken!"}, {"start": 988.56, "end": 990.56, "text": "A fenced taken."}, {"start": 995.56, "end": 997.56, "text": "Well, he is right about one thing."}, {"start": 997.56, "end": 999.56, "text": "You're all terrible people."}, {"start": 999.56, "end": 1002.56, "text": "And I don't care about the stupidest time, and I'm going home."}, {"start": 1004.56, "end": 1005.56, "text": "No, I'm not."}, {"start": 1005.56, "end": 1008.56, "text": "Going to biology class starts in 15 minutes."}, {"start": 1012.56, "end": 1017.6, "text": "And eventually, this caterpillar will come out of its cocoon, and then..."}, {"start": 1017.6, "end": 1019.36, "text": "Papa!"}, {"start": 1019.36, "end": 1022.16, "text": "[cheering]"}, {"st